                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{aligned}P(A\\mid B)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}\\\\p&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{p^2}\\\\P(A\\cap B)&=p^3\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(A)}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{p^3}{p^{\\frac{1}{3}}}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=p^{3-\\frac{1}{3}}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=p^{\\frac{8}{3}}\\end{aligned}",
                "display": true
